              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Craig"
            },
            "reviewBody": "First off, there is no way this cooks completely in an hour at 325 degrees. Mine took 1h 45min, so plan accordingly. I have never had this dessert before so my impressions have nothing to refer to other than my preferences. That being said, I made it exactly as written (aside from the cook time). My girlfriend and I tasted it both warm and cold and cold is definitely better (We just couldn't wait for it to cool off...) Overall though, it was ok, not overly sweet and really easy to make but not good enough for me to make it again.",
