              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Josephina Maietta"
            },
            "reviewBody": "No Pineapple!! to make it the way it is meant to be made it is with Lemon zest and orange zest. candied fruit if you like. I found if you use just the orange zest with a concentrated mango, orange juice you get a much better taste and you sprinkle with powdered sugar when cool Acerca Napoli",
