              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LakeFairy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was the BEST rice pie I have ever had. My husband is Italian and they all rave about \"their\" rice pie as being the best. I always found them dry and unpleasant. One Easter I asked my husband, \"if rice pie is so great, why it is only made once a year?\" Then I hosted Easter and found this recipe. I actually wrote on the printed out recipe \"OMG - Can't believe rice pie could be this good!\" This is the 3rd year I am making it but also make it several times a year for neighborhood gatherings.\nThe only additions I made was 2 C of rice instead of 1. I also added lemon zest. \nThis is a keeper!!!",
            "datePublished": "2017-04-14T20:53:30.727Z"
